  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Consider&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>100</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>100</mn></msup></msup><mo>,</mo></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>100</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8970;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math></p><p>(upto <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>100</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;terms)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>&#8970;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced open=\"&#8970;\" close=\"\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>&#8970;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></m